- content_for :page_header do
  = render "layouts/components/page_header",
           title: "Pôles",
           links: [link_to("+ Nouveau pôle", new_team_path, class: "inline-flex items-center rounded-md bg-4s-main px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-white shadow-sm hover:opacity-90")]

.max-w-5xl.space-y-4
  p.text-sm.text-gray-500
    | Les pôles sont l'unité d'organisation des 4 Sources. La hiérarchie s'arrête à deux niveaux : des pôles analytiques fins sous des pôles économiques et des services support.

  .overflow-hidden.rounded-2xl.bg-white.ring-1.ring-gray-200
    table.w-full.text-sm
      thead.text-xs.uppercase.tracking-wide.text-gray-500(class="bg-gray-50/60")
        tr
          th.px-4.py-3.text-left Pôle
          th.px-4.py-3.text-left Type
          th.px-4.py-3.text-left Code analytique
          th.px-4.py-3.text-left Référent·e·s
          th.px-4.py-3.text-right Membres
          th.px-4.py-3
      tbody
        - if @rows.empty?
          tr
            td.px-4.py-4.text-gray-500(colspan="6") Aucun pôle pour l'instant.
        - @rows.each do |team|
          tr.border-t.border-gray-100
            td.px-4.py-3
              - if team.parent_id
                .flex.items-center.gap-2
                  span.text-gray-300 └
                  = link_to team.name, team_path(team), class: "font-medium text-gray-900 hover:underline"
                .ml-6.text-xs.text-gray-400 = "sous #{team.parent.name}"
              - else
                = link_to team.name, team_path(team), class: "font-semibold text-gray-900 hover:underline"
            td.px-4.py-3
              - if team.kind
                span.inline-flex.items-center.rounded-full.bg-teal-100.px-2.py-0.5.text-xs.font-medium.text-teal-800
                  = team.kind_label
              - else
                span.text-gray-400 —
            td.px-4.py-3.font-mono.text-xs.text-gray-500
              = team.analytic_code.presence || "—"
            td.px-4.py-3.text-gray-600
              - referents = team.referents
              = referents.any? ? referents.map(&:name).join(", ") : content_tag(:span, "—", class: "text-gray-400")
            td.px-4.py-3.text-right.font-medium.text-gray-900
              = team.team_memberships.size
            td.px-4.py-3.text-right.whitespace-nowrap
              = link_to "Modifier", edit_team_path(team), class: "text-xs font-medium text-gray-700 hover:underline"
